sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Launch command
    participant Wrapper as Secret Wrapper
    participant Adapter as Provider adapter
    participant Store as Secret store
    participant Browser as Local form
    participant Target as MCP server or tool

    Caller->>Wrapper: Start command with binds
    Wrapper->>Adapter: Resolve every selector
    Adapter->>Store: Read stored values
    Store-->>Adapter: Values or confirmed missing

    alt Every value exists
        Adapter-->>Wrapper: Resolved values
    else A value is missing
        Adapter-->>Wrapper: Authorization required
        Wrapper->>Browser: Ask for all missing values
        Browser-->>Wrapper: Submit values
        Wrapper->>Adapter: Save values
        Adapter->>Store: Write and read again
        Store-->>Adapter: Resolved values
        Adapter-->>Wrapper: All binds ready
    end

    Wrapper->>Target: Launch with bound environment
